          "Provenance": {
            ".machine-translate": "Never",
            ".en": "<p>Kept by Anna Cartwright (1871–1952) from age sixteen until her marriage. Passed to her daughter Evelyn, then to Helen Cartwright, her granddaughter. Helen noted in her 2019 donation letter that her grandmother \"pressed one flower from each garden she ever kept,\" and that several species in the album no longer grow in the county.</p>"
          },
