          "Notes": "<p>Binding cracked but stable. Recommend support cradle for display. The <em>Provenance</em> field carries a <code>.machine-translate: \"Never\"</code> policy — the grandmother's phrasing is a historical quotation that must not be auto-translated.</p>"
        }
